@startuml
!include ../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/behavioral/statemachine-diagram-style.iuml
title Run State | Proposed agent harness
[*] --> Pending
Pending --> Running : claim
Running --> AwaitingApproval : approval required
AwaitingApproval --> Running : approved / revalidate
AwaitingApproval --> Failed : denied / expired
Running --> Reconciling : side effect uncertain
Reconciling --> Running : verified outcome / remaining budget
Reconciling --> Failed : unresolved / manual escalation
Running --> Running : checkpoint / bounded retry
Running --> Completed : verified completion
Running --> Failed : denial / budget / fatal error
Running --> Cancelled : cancellation
AwaitingApproval --> Cancelled : cancellation
Reconciling --> Cancelled : cancellation / retain uncertainty
Completed --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
legend bottom
Arrow = permitted transition with trigger; black dot = initial / terminal marker.
Status: proposed, not implementation evidence.
endlegend
@enduml
